<title>UK: British Columbia sets 2.0 bln ffr 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>British Columbia sets 2.0 bln ffr 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joijnt lead managers Pariba snd Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVINCE OF BRITISH COLUMBIA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.875     MATURITY    15.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.555   PAY DATE    15.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.905    SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
